	Final words

	This util has been developed and updated under a very long period.
	The first version was made for /X 1.1x so you could imagine.
	6 months ago I thought this was the best account editor available,
	well it actually was the only replacement editor available. Now 6
	months later I still thinks this one is the best, compared to the
	built in.. There are no opponents nowadays either and I can only
	say thank you! Becouse with that you all have proved that there
	is no need for another one than this and I will continue to update
	this one to even fit your needs in the future. Maybe there will
	come a C version later this year, but no promises. It depends on
	how much time I can spare for producing this account editor.
 
	I hope you will get very much use of this util, or you won't se
	if it helps or not becouse your board will not be hacked (hope
	fully), but if your board doesn't get hacked you can thank this
	util and your other utils like them from Maltese Falcon!

	These are some other doors that I've made, Quest, Sysop Uploader,
	File Comment, Virtual Vote, Connect, Node Activities, News mag,
	Log Viewer, Config Ed, Virtual Chart, LastCallers Util, DirXCleaner
	MailServer (DNET), Members and Password Fail!

	If I get the chance I hope to have a chat with you at a party,
	maybe Computer Crossroads or at European Computer Conference,
	invitation text to the last party is supplied within this archive!
	I would be gratefull if you called my board and come with complaints,
	ideas or whatever you may come up with on all my doors!

